    {
      "source": "<code>checkInherited</code> - whether to also check the superclasses and\ninterfaces as well as meta-annotations for the annotation type\n(i.e. whether to use <a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotatedElementUtils.html#hasAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.Class)\"><code>AnnotatedElementUtils.hasAnnotation(AnnotatedElement, Class)</code></a>\nsemantics instead of standard Java <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isAnnotationPresent(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.isAnnotationPresent(Class)</code></a>)",
      "translation": "<code>checkInherited</code> - 是否还要检查父类和接口以及该注解类型的元注解（即，是使用 <a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotatedElementUtils.html#hasAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.Class)\"><code>AnnotatedElementUtils.hasAnnotation(AnnotatedElement, Class)</code></a> 语义而不是标准的 Java <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isAnnotationPresent(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.isAnnotationPresent(Class)</code></a>)。",
      "count": 2
    },
